            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Just an FYI, [the mapping of `<C-W>` in terminal mode](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/d613f3be2bb215e62317e711ddc7196c969acf9e/lua/mini/basics.lua#L597) breaks the shortcut for delete word in TUI apps that use readline. I'm finding it pretty frustrating and wish there was a way to turn off that mapping.",
